        a painless, efficient and nearly invisble system to move teeths to the right <br />

        position. <br />

        Since almost 2o years the system has been improved and has proven itself in numerous <br />

        cases all over the world! Prof. Dr. Kim has improved his Clear-Aligner system <br />

        with full digitization, new materials and improved procedures and this is now <br />

        called the iSmilealigner system which allows us to offer you an optimal therapy!

    </p>


    <p class="lead">>>  iSmile - best choice for adult therapies  <<</p>

    <p>
        It is no secret that a beatiful smile is very attractive. <br />

        Now you can fullfill your wish for a beautiful smile with an almost invisible therapy.
    </p>

