    <p>
        We all know that especially teenagers dislike conventional braces and brackets for <br />
        
        orthodontics. iSmilealigner offers teenagers the perfect alternative and one worry <br />

        less through puberty.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">>>  No more annoying dental braces for kids  <<</p>

    <p>
        The thin iSmile rails are the perfect alternative to conventional dental braces because

        they are less invasive to the oral cavity than the metal wires, braces, brackets

        and glue. Additionally many children sleep and breath with open mouth and can loose

        the conventional system more easily. In such cases the conventional methods of

        orthodontics are useless.
    </p>

    <p class="lead">
        >>  Using the crystal clear plastic rails will achieve <br />

        a perfect orthodontics result <<
